<title>GERMANY: ATHLETICS-NEW HAMMER WORLD RECORD FOR KUZENKOVA.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-NEW HAMMER WORLD RECORD FOR KUZENKOVA.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olga Kuzenkova of Russia set a women's world hammer record of 73.10 metres at the European Cup Final on Sunday.</p>
<p>The previous best was 69.58, set by Mihaela Melinte of Romania in Bucharest in March. Kuzenkova reached 71.22 in her first throw and then improved it to 73.10. Melinte also broke her own old record with a throw of 69.76.</p>
</text>
